# User Management

## Create a user

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer state=present"
```

## Create a user with home directory

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer create_home=yes"
```

## Create a user with Bash shell

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer shell=/bin/bash"
```

## Add a user to a group

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer groups=sudo append=yes"
```

## Create multiple users

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name={{ item }} state=present"
```

## Lock a user account

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer password_lock=yes"
```

## Unlock a user account

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer password_lock=no"
```

## Delete a user

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer state=absent"
```

## Delete a user with home directory

```bash
ansible all -b -m user -a "name=developer state=absent remove=yes"
```

## Display current logged-in users

```bash
ansible all -m shell -a "who"
```
